data_vse2
# Phase identity: ambient normal-state 1T-VSe2, P-3m1, not a 2H monolayer.
# Provenance: Barua et al., Sci. Rep. 7, 10964 (2017), CC BY 4.0, for the
# single-crystal cell; Se z=0.257 from Stahl et al., Inorganics 11, 481 (2023),
# CC BY 4.0, cross-checked against the public NIST JARVIS JVASP-10 record.
# The Se-V-Se sheets stack along c, giving cleavage surface (001).
# Limiting checks: V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, 1V+2Se, finite basal (001) coupling.
# Validation: vse2-p3m1-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.357
_cell_length_b 3.357
_cell_length_c 6.104
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
